WEBVTT

00:00:28.402 --> 00:00:30.350
Ed, welcome to the TED stage.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:33.961
What can you see, as a matter of fact?

00:00:33.961 --> 00:00:35.699
Edward Snowden: Ha, I can see everyone.

00:00:35.699 --> 00:00:37.949
This is amazing.

00:00:37.949 --> 00:00:41.162
(Laughter)

00:00:41.162 --> 00:00:44.445
CA: Ed, some questions for you.

00:00:44.445 --> 00:00:45.738
You've been called many things

00:00:45.738 --> 00:00:47.303
in the last few months.

00:00:47.303 --> 00:00:52.228
You've been called a whistleblower, a traitor,

00:00:52.228 --> 00:00:53.957
a hero.

00:00:53.957 --> 00:00:57.774
What words would you describe yourself with?

00:00:57.774 --> 00:01:00.436
ES: You know, everybody who is involved